OL,3,GNEWSAMajor towns set for 20mph speed
OL,4,Alimits under new roads programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree of Ayrshire's largest towns could
OL,7,Fsee 20mph speed limits introduced as
OL,8,Fthe rollout of lower limits continues
OL,9,Facross the region.
OL,11,FAyr, Troon and Prestwick have been
OL,12,Fidentified for a future phase of the
OL,13,FAyrshire Roads Alliance (ARA)
OL,14,Fprogramme, which has already introduced
OL,15,Fthe 20mph limits in a number of
OL,16,Fcommunities.
OL,18,FWork has been completed in Girvan and
OL,19,Fis currently ongoing to introduce the
OL,20,Flimits in Coylton, Maybole, Barr and
OL,21,FPinmore.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
