OL,3,GNEWSAMajor towns set for 20mph speed
OL,4,Alimits under new roads programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo timetable has been provided for the
OL,7,Fphase that would bring the limits to
OL,8,FTroon, Prestwick and Ayr.
